@baseUrl = http://localhost:5286
@token = paste-jwt-here

### Login as Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### List employees (page, filter, sort) — requires Bearer token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees?page=1&pageSize=10&search=John&sortBy=salary&sortDir=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get employee 1001
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees/1001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create employee (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Neha",
  "lastName": "Rao",
  "email": "neha.rao@company.com",
  "salary": 65000,
  "departmentId": 2,
  "skills": [
    { "name": "Excel", "years": 2 }
  ]
}

### Department raise (Admin or HR)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments/1/raise
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "percent": 5
}
